{'symbol': 'DISH', 'date': '2021-11-10 17:00:00', 'title': 'DISH NETWORK PLACES OFFERING OF $5,250,000,000 IN SENIOR SECURED NOTES', 'text': 'ENGLEWOOD, COLO., NOV. 10, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DISH NETWORK CORPORATION ("DISH NETWORK") (NASDAQ: DISH) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS SUBSIDIARY,\xa0DISH DBS CORPORATION ("DISH DBS"), PRICED AN OFFERING OF $2,750,000,000 AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF ITS 5.25% SENIOR SECURED NOTES DUE 2026 (THE "2026 NOTES") AND $2,500,000,000 AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF ITS 5.75% SENIOR SECURED NOTES DUE 2028 (THE "2028 NOTES" AND, TOGETHER WITH THE 2026 NOTES, THE "NOTES").'}